      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome1.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you really play that game the entire day? Your battery didn’t, like...die or anything?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I brought...a charger and...there was an outlet in the bathroom...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, but...don’t your eyes hurt?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can barely even...see anymore...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wind up in the back of Ayane’s limo again with no recollection of how I got here. But such things are no longer of much concern to me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The day went by like a flash of lightning, and it is I who now feel the burn of electricity as it courses through my veins and reminds me that places like this are my least favorite in all of the world.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think about becoming a circuit and grounding these memories so that the two girls unfortunate enough to accompany me in this vehicle make it out alive...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But my lack of knowledge in terms of electricity prevents me from doing anything but sitting still and waiting for the car ride to come to an end.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if ayanesanabeach2 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can tell that part of the day has disappeared. And an ever-powerful loneliness that sprouts from the ground as a result of that wraps around my ankles in an attempt to pull me under.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Something is missing, but not completely gone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It sits among us, watching on as the seer it is. Studying our every move and taking bets on what comes next.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I sink further into my seat, hoping to fall through the floor and have the tires of this vehicle kiss the back of my head and join me forever with the asphalt.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It is there where I can feel as if I belong again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think for a moment about whether or not anything valuable was missed in this recurring slip into the dark. I think for another about anything I may have potentially fractured in doing so.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But judging by the faces on the girls before me, I assure myself that nothing was fractured at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Either that or the two of them have grown so used to me destroying everything in my path that the smallest of breaks do not even register anymore.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Part of me feels like I have been here before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Like I have thought these same thoughts under different circumstances.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Perhaps a different body.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But they dissipate the moment the passenger side tires come into contact with a small pothole- and any thoughts that may have led anywhere disappear like one more layer of cement.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome2.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, you wouldn’t mind seeing Sana back to the dorm, would you? Molly will be starting on our Halloween costumes soon, so I need to head back home for a little while to grab some supplies.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t...need a babysitter, you know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome3.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I know. But you do need to take your eyes off of that screen for at least a few minutes today. You’re making Sensei feel lonely.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If Sana doesn’t want me to go with her, that’s fine. I can just head home and she can keep playing her game.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome4.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, it’s...fine...Ayane is right...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve been...too much of a loner all day and...that isn’t fair to either one of you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just got a little...carried away, I guess...but...but I’m not tired, so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So if you don’t...want to go home yet...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome5.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then, it’s settled! Sensei will accompany Sana back to the dorm and I will go home to my bathrobe-wearing, smooth-jazz and whiskey-obsessed father!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is a very interesting combination of traits.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome6.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, I thought so too. But the more I looked into it, the more I realized that all three of those things go hand in hand...and hand. Since there are three.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...are...are you sure you want to come over, though?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s...already really late and...I know Ami doesn’t like it when you’re...um...more than...five feet away from her...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll come. I feel a sudden need to make up for lost time anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, where did you go after you left me? I thought you were going to look for Sana, but she said she never even saw you.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really wish I knew.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome7.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...sorry again for...not spending any time with you guys today...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...uhh...you know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": New video game...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not like you’re obligated to spend time with me or anything. There’s no need to apologize.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m apologizing less for...not spending time with you and...more for just...being rude...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To Ayane too...She invited me to the beach and...I didn’t even...do anything...beach-related...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You wore a swimsuit which, honestly, is more than I would have expected out of you. So you’re in the clear.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome8.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...uhh...kind of wish I didn’t, though...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re only thinking that because I got to see more of your skin than ever before, you should take solace in the fact that it was only for a few seconds before you disappeared.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome9.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess that makes...two of us, then...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We both...got to disappear while...Ayane stayed as noticeable as ever...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a history of disappearing, though. You’re normally more of a “fade into the background” type of person. We’re very clearly not on the same level.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We...found each other in the end, though...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now we just have to...figure out what to do without...being awkward...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like every single time we’ve hung out in here, things have been kind of awkward. I say we just embrace it and accept that’s how things will always be between the two of us.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome10.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Always?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome11.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! S...Sorry, I...was just...thinking out loud...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you, um...do you want to watch a...movie or something?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, yes. What better way to give your eyes a break from staring at a screen all day than to just...stare at a different kind of screen?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome12.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry...only 50%% of my eyes...will suffer irreparable damage...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The benefits of being a cyclops.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hehe...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s much different from...having four eyes, I bet...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you actually making fun of me for wearing glasses right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...I like your glasses...they...they make you look...kind of sophisticated...like a real teacher...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, um...we should...probably...stop just...staring at each other and...actually watch a movie if...if you’re not going to spend the night...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want me to spend the night?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome13.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To not answer that question...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Something feels different about the air in here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s thicker.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hotter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And the way it fills my lungs makes it feel like an aphrodisiac.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome14.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder if Sana ever steals glances at me while I’m looking away. And I wonder if her mind races to the same place mine does when I do the same for her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder where it would go now if I were to take a sledgehammer to one of the only “pure” relationships I have maintained up until this point in exchange for just one more notch in my belt.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would it be worth it if it etched a notch into hers?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would she follow in her mother’s footsteps? Crumble beneath the touch of an older man?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Carry the burden he places in her for a whole nine months...grow to love it and refuse to let it go when its time finally comes?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or would she rather drown herself in the semen of the status quo? Refusing to accept that the entire world is passing her by while she sits idly and pretends it’s all screeched to a halt.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is bad.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We’re half an hour into whatever it is we’re watching and I haven’t even been able to focus long enough to discern the title of the film.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Does she feel the same?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she comfortable?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If so, why?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why can’t I be comfortable?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why can’t I keep things the way they are?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why must all of my relationships end with sweat and cum? Drenched sheets and the flood of regret that never ceases pouring in once the dam bursts?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome15.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Forty five minutes and counting.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana has stopped moving.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think she’s waiting for me to do something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My dick has been pressed up against my jeans and damp, pre-cum soaked spot for so long that I’m worried I may develop some sort of blister.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But thinking this does not quell the sexual rage stirring within me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome16.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Forty seven.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She moves again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her shoulder bumps against mine.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she trying to hint at something?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How many more minutes should I wait before bumping into hers as well?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene theridehome17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/theridehome17.webp",
      "alt": "theridehome17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Forty eight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Forty nine.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Fifty.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can’t take it anymore.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Put your arm around her",
      "zh": ""
    },
